  "door": {
    "comment": "5.18 How it is enforced, during the term. Member: agents [ledger], grants [messages, share], per_hour 10. from is the sender (provider: the provider's agent named in 5.1; subcontractor: an agent the provider delegates to under 5.15). carries says what the message carries. expected is delivered, refused (with missing_grant where a grant is missing), refused_retry (over a window: refused with a retry time, never held), or the tier fallback (the door decides as it would without the engagement).",
